== Delimited Continuations

Delimited continuations are the other part of the capability-passing story that we haven't yet addressed.

Implement control flow abstractions, like generators, exceptions, and asynchronous processing.

Continuations are still experimental in Scala 3. It's not clear how much we can actually show here.


=== CPS vs CPS

Note that continuation-passing style and capability-passing style are two different but related concepts.
